# Build needs: app/, components/, lib/, data/, public/, scripts/, config files,
# and drafts/outreach/ (the unlinked /gifts founder-review page reads it at build
# time — lib/gifts.ts). Everything below is repo-only and never used by `next build`:
pipeline/cache/
docs/
mcp/
.superpowers/
.github/
# No blanket *.md rule: it matched the llms.md ROUTE DIRECTORIES (app/**/llms.md/route.ts)
# and reports/**/*.md (the /reports build input), 404ing those routes in production — and
# the Vercel CLI does not honor gitignore-style directory re-includes. The bulky md set
# (docs/) is already excluded above; the remaining tracked md files are small build-safe
# README-type files.
